NOTICE
======

This repository vendors third-party work. The list below is what is redistributed
here, who wrote it, and under what terms. Full license texts are in
`third_party/licenses/`.

Everything outside `.agents/skills/` and `.claude/skills/` — `lab/`, `playbook/`,
`docs/`, and the root documents — is this repository's own work.

Why these are vendored at all: the `v5` drill measured what installed community
design skill packs contribute to an AI-built UI. Reproducing that measurement
requires the exact pack contents that were present, so they are committed rather
than installed at setup time. `skills-lock.json` records the source and content
hash of each. They are included as research apparatus, not as an improvement on,
or a fork of, the originals.

Both directories hold the same 24 packs. `.claude/skills/` is 23 symlinks into
`.agents/skills/` plus one real directory (`impeccable`).

