Provenance and corrections
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Sources were read from `skills-lock.json` (which records 23 of the 24 packs) and,
for impeccable, from the published npm package metadata. Upstream license texts
were retrieved from each project's repository.

The packs are unmodified. `playbook/findings/v5.md` and `v5-conflicts.md` describe
where their advice was deliberately overridden, and why — those are disagreements
recorded in this repository's own documents, not changes to anyone's pack.

If you maintain one of these projects and want the attribution corrected, the
vendored copy removed, or the framing changed, please open an issue.

