Fonts — SIL Open Font License 1.1
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`lab/public/fonts/` holds two latin-subset woff2 files, redistributed under the
OFL. They are self-hosted rather than linked from fonts.googleapis.com because
this lab's primary instrument is a screenshot: when the font host is unreachable
the page silently renders in a fallback face, and a review pass will approve the
wrong typography without ever knowing it did.

