Other credits
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`lab/src/routes/v7/` reproduces the visual language of https://filmhood.in — its
palette, type pairing, card treatment and section rhythm — as a design exercise.
No code, markup, stylesheet or asset was copied from that site; the spec it was
built against was a set of measured values (computed styles and colour counts)
read off the live page. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Filmhood.

Poster artwork referenced by `lab/` is served from TMDB (https://www.themoviedb.org)
by URL and is not redistributed in this repository. One deliberate exception, decided by
the repository owner on 2026-08-20: the private published sandbox preview (a Claude
artifact page, whose content-security policy cannot load remote images) embeds low-res
poster thumbnails as data URIs at bundle time. Those bytes live only in that preview
page, never in this repository — the local `.posters-cache/` they are built from is
gitignored. This product uses the TMDB API but is not
endorsed or certified by TMDB. Release dates were compiled from FilmiBeat, myvi.in,
FilmyChill and Boston.com; see `lab/src/data/releases.js`.
